    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/extras/b524aeaad88ad596c52776622f0a8c77.poster.avif?t=1745357135\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/extras/b524aeaad88ad596c52776622f0a8c77.webm?t=1745357135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/extras/b524aeaad88ad596c52776622f0a8c77.mp4?t=1745357135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lost Colony \u2013 Uncover the Secrets of a Doomed World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded on a long-abandoned space colony, you must fight to survive against relentless alien horrors and rogue security drones. <strong>Lost Colony</strong> is a fast-paced <strong>twin-stick shooter roguelike</strong> that challenges you to <strong>adapt, explore, and uncover</strong> the truth hidden beneath the planet\u2019s surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Intense Twin-Stick Combat</strong> \u2013 Take on waves of deadly creatures and malfunctioning defense systems with fluid, responsive controls. Dodge, shoot, and strategize your way through relentless battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/extras/7f1d865dae6d274a434be36b8ac7ea1f.poster.avif?t=1745357135\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/extras/7f1d865dae6d274a434be36b8ac7ea1f.webm?t=1745357135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/extras/7f1d865dae6d274a434be36b8ac7ea1f.mp4?t=1745357135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>A Mysterious, Hostile World</strong> \u2013 Explore the remnants of a forgotten colony, from derelict research labs to eerie alien caverns, each hiding dangers and secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/extras/01a79caacaa636f208d5a97ff8a34c8e.poster.avif?t=1745357135\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/extras/01a79caacaa636f208d5a97ff8a34c8e.webm?t=1745357135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/extras/01a79caacaa636f208d5a97ff8a34c8e.mp4?t=1745357135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Upgrade &amp; Adapt</strong> \u2013 Collect <strong>tech parts</strong> from fallen enemies and hidden caches to enhance your weapons, unlock powerful abilities, and improve your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/extras/634cc270fe7b027457ce907fbbb30ecb.poster.avif?t=1745357135\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/extras/634cc270fe7b027457ce907fbbb30ecb.webm?t=1745357135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/extras/634cc270fe7b027457ce907fbbb30ecb.mp4?t=1745357135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 <strong>Boost Your Drone Companion</strong> \u2013 Discover <strong>power-ups</strong> during your runs to enhance your drone\u2019s abilities, from defensive shields to devastating energy blasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/extras/c43d11e37f85d1b4fd0045aae24c001f.poster.avif?t=1745357135\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/extras/c43d11e37f85d1b4fd0045aae24c001f.webm?t=1745357135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/extras/c43d11e37f85d1b4fd0045aae24c001f.mp4?t=1745357135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Procedurally Generated Challenges</strong> \u2013 No two runs are the same! Each playthrough offers fresh enemy encounters, level layouts, and loot to keep the experience dynamic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/extras/0175f00746455ff5b72dde3298756c74.poster.avif?t=1745357135\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/extras/0175f00746455ff5b72dde3298756c74.webm?t=1745357135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/extras/0175f00746455ff5b72dde3298756c74.mp4?t=1745357135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e <strong>Unravel the Colony\u2019s Dark Past</strong> \u2013 What happened to the settlers? Who\u2014or what\u2014is lurking in the shadows? Piece together the story as you fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to uncover the <strong>Lost Colony\u2019s</strong> secrets before it's too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
